<concept id="t00374">
	<title>Downshifting</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>manual transmission
					<indexterm>downshifting</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<ul id="e02432">
			<li>
				<p>When slowing in heavy traffic or driving uphill, downshift before the engine begins to labor.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Downshifting helps prevent stalling and provides better acceleration when you need to increase speed again.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>When driving downhill, downshifting helps maintain a safe speed and reduces brake wear.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
